WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Welcome to our intro to new seller incentives.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:10.000
In this video, we'll cover the eligibility requirements and perks of the new seller incentives program.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.273
Starting your selling journey in the Amazon store?

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:19.000
This program can help kickstart your business by investing in your success early on.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.455
The new seller incentives program is a curated suite of benefits designed to scale your business,

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:27.000
promote your products and grow your brand.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.500
You're eligible to receive new seller incentives if you're registered as a professional seller and

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:43.000
launched your first buyable product in the US, UK, Germany, Italy, France, Spain or Japan on or

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
after January 1, 2022.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.647
You're also eligible for the program if you're an existing seller looking to expand your business

00:00:50.647 --> 00:00:52.059
to other Amazon stores.

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:57.706
For instance, if you're currently only selling your products in the US store, you become eligible

00:00:57.706 --> 00:01:03.000
for new seller incentives when you list your first buyable product in the UK store.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.964
The program offers four perks tied to the following, Amazon brand registry, fulfillment by Amazon

00:01:09.964 --> 00:01:12.750
or FBA, coupons and Amazon ads.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.000
Let's take a closer look at each.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:23.105
Once you've enrolled in Amazon brand registry, you'll receive a 5% bonus credit on up to $1 million

00:01:23.105 --> 00:01:30.211
in branded sales or for the duration of one year after you've become eligible for the bonus, whichever

00:01:30.211 --> 00:01:31.000
comes first.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.333
This bonus is applied to your referral fees.

00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:40.167
For example, let's say you made $500,000 in branded sales in a single month.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:47.250
In this case, you'd be eligible for a bonus credit of $25,000 that will automatically be applied

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.000
as a discount to the following month's referral fees.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:57.303
With the amount you earned back, you can invest in other growth opportunities for your business.

00:01:57.303 --> 00:02:03.606
For example, you could use advertising tools to help promote your products and grow your customer

00:02:03.606 --> 00:02:04.000
audience.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:10.881
You could create deals that help make your products more enticing to customers or invest in new

00:02:10.881 --> 00:02:12.905
product opportunities for your brand.

00:02:12.905 --> 00:02:18.571
With new seller incentives, you'll also receive credits for Amazon Vine and Amazon Transparency

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:21.000
once you enroll in those programs.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:28.600
You will receive $200 credits for Vine, our tool to kickstart your product reviews through selected

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:30.975
customers enrolled in the program.

00:02:30.975 --> 00:02:37.625
You will receive $100 credits for Amazon Transparency, our product serialization service that helps

00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:40.000
identify and prevent counterfeit products.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.362
One of the other perks applies to fulfillment by Amazon or FBA.

00:02:45.362 --> 00:02:52.064
Once joining the new seller incentives program, you'll receive $100 in credits for inventory shipping

00:02:52.064 --> 00:02:59.213
fees when using the Amazon partnered carrier program or $200 in credits for fulfillment fees when

00:02:59.213 --> 00:03:01.000
using Amazon Global Logistics.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:08.040
You'll also be auto-enrolled in the FBA New Selection Program, which offers free monthly storage

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.000
and return processing for eligible new to FBA ASINs.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.632
You can search FBA New Selection Program in Seller Central to learn more about the program and its

00:03:18.632 --> 00:03:19.000
benefits.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:27.571
When you use FBA, you can also become eligible to receive $50 in credits for your sponsored products

00:03:27.571 --> 00:03:29.000
campaign's promotional clicks.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:34.727
Sponsored products campaigns can help increase the discoverability of your products as they appear

00:03:34.727 --> 00:03:38.000
in search results or on product detail pages.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:44.588
Finally, if you're using coupons, you'll get $50 in coupon credits through the new seller incentives

00:03:44.588 --> 00:03:45.000
program.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:51.400
With coupons, you can offer percentage or money-off discounts to help increase the visibility of

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.000
your products and make them more attractive to customers.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.000
This concludes our intro to the new seller incentives program.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store!
